  "description": "SQLite provider for the Elarion.Migrations SQL migration engine (ADR-0060), for single-node / edge EF-free (NativeAOT) hosts: embedded V{version}__/R__ scripts, SHA-256 checksums over line-ending-normalized content, and history rows that commit in the same transaction as their script — so there is no repair command and no failed-row limbo. Serializes runners with a connection-held exclusive lock (SQLite's locking_mode=EXCLUSIVE). Startup-applied via a hosted service. The EF tier keeps EF Core migrations.",
